Subject: [PATCH 123/123] PC5: saturate in a vertex shader before vs_3_0 is max and min
 (Wine patch 0952)

Far Cry's own d3dx9 assembler refused the mov_sat vkd3d-shader wrote in a vs_2_0 listing, and drew the sun's glow without its shader.
